<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Monday it restarted coverage of Cymer Inc with a strong buy rating, after having been restricted from commenting on the shares.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley managed the company's initial public offering and was involved in its other share offerings.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
